# <package arch> <Depends, comma-separated or ->
#
# One static musl binary per CPU family, no runtime dependencies (TLS is
# rustls, built in). apk matches the architecture name exactly, so the three
# Pi architectures are three packages of the same aarch64 binary.
mipsel_24kc          -
# The GL-SFT1200's architecture: apk matches the name exactly, and a repository
# for mipsel_24kc is not one for it. The same soft-float binary; interAptiv's FPU
# is simply unused. Run it on an Opal before the first release that offers it.
mipsel_24kc_24kf     -
aarch64_cortex-a53   -
aarch64_cortex-a72   -
aarch64_cortex-a76   -
